WEBVTT

00:08:24.917 --> 00:08:30.381
I was minding my business,
as one does, perusing social media,

00:08:30.381 --> 00:08:32.675
and I saw people excelling in a space

00:08:32.675 --> 00:08:35.469
where I, you know,
traditionally had a lot of success.

00:08:36.178 --> 00:08:37.805
So I’m looking at it and I’m like,

00:08:37.805 --> 00:08:40.307
“Well, why the hell
they ain’t call me for that job?”

00:08:41.392 --> 00:08:43.227
And I have this, like, angst,

00:08:43.227 --> 00:08:45.896
and then I realize
they didn’t call me for that job

00:08:45.896 --> 00:08:48.232
because you already said
you didn’t want that job.

00:08:48.232 --> 00:08:50.943
You told the universe
you weren’t into working like that.

00:08:50.943 --> 00:08:52.069
You don’t want a job --

00:08:52.069 --> 00:08:53.070
I really don’t.

00:08:53.195 --> 00:08:54.196
(Laughter)

00:08:54.280 --> 00:08:55.281
I’m not into it.

00:08:55.781 --> 00:08:57.491
So...

00:08:57.491 --> 00:08:58.993
that’s why it happened.

00:08:59.285 --> 00:09:04.206
And what I realize is that intellectually
I had grown and evolved,